"""
NyxForge NGO Admin mockup generator.
Generates docs/storyboards/out/bounty-admin-mockup.html

4 frames:
  1. Dashboard        -- summary cards, campaign list
  2. Campaign Detail  -- funding progress, backer list, judge verdicts
  3. Create Campaign  -- form: title, terms, deadline, fee, judges
  4. Judge Management -- judge roster, invite form
"""
